# Bloomvine Regent cast from the hand as its Omen, Claim Territory ({2}{G}, CR 720.3): "Search your library for up to two basic
# Forest cards, reveal them, put one onto the battlefield tapped and the other into your hand, then shuffle." The nonbasic
# Bayou (a Forest) and the basic Mountain are refused, and so are three Forests (it is up to two). Bot1 finds two Forests,
# both revealed, and chooses one for the battlefield: it enters tapped, and the other goes into the hand. As Claim Territory
# resolves it is shuffled into Bot1's library (CR 720.3d): ten cards, two taken and one added. The creature was never cast,
# so no enters trigger gained Bot1 3 life.

